---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon-32.png" />
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/apple-touch-icon.png" />
<title>Retail Due Manager — The Ledger That Never Forgets a Rupee</title>
<meta name="description" content="Offline-first due &amp; ledger management for retail and wholesale shops. Raise invoices, collect payments, and keep every account balanced — online or off.">
